    # From the demonstrations: matching edge shapes project their colors
    # inward perpendicular to the edge. Isolated 2s mark where the projected
    # ray is interrupted and turn into 4; extend left/right rails only in rows
    # where a 2 target occurs, using the target's color for the segment.
